msgid "Solid panels and brighter text and edges, for readability over busy scenes."
msgstr "不透明なパネルと明るい文字・縁取りで、背景が複雑でも読みやすくします。"

#. Key:	ReducedMotionLabel
#. SourceLocation:	Source/MVVMSample/Accessibility/GothamSettingsTable.cpp(82)
#: Source/MVVMSample/Accessibility/GothamSettingsTable.cpp(82)
