#. SourceLocation:	Source/MVVMSample/Accessibility/GothamSettingsTable.cpp(83)
#: Source/MVVMSample/Accessibility/GothamSettingsTable.cpp(83)
msgctxt "Gotham.Settings,ReducedMotionDesc"
msgid "Turns off pops, slides, pulses, screen transitions and rain streaks. Colour cues stay on."
msgstr "ポップ、スライド、パルス、画面遷移、雨の筋をオフにします。色による合図は残ります。"

#. Key:	WheelModeLabel
